message: "If you use or build on this work, please cite it as below."
title: "CTI as code: the threat intelligence program as version-controlled, CI-validated records"
abstract: >
  Cyber threat intelligence as code. Priority intelligence requirements,
  collection sources, decoys, detection candidates, campaigns, adjudicated
  cases and agent contracts held as version-controlled records whose
  cross-references and standards are enforced as CI gates, with a reference
  implementation and a worked example program.
type: software
